{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493824,"name":"Izumi March","username":"Izumi_March","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/i/f6c823/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T10:56:21.670Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e日本語:\u003cbr\u003e\nWindows の Grok Bot を使っています。最初は「送信に失敗」でした。Reset Grok Bot’s Computer を1回実行して完了しました。その後、メッセージは黒い吹き出しで送れたように見えますが、hello でも返信が来ません。Computer 画面は見えます。Privacy Mode は有効です。再ログイン済みです。Reset の再実行はしていません。サーバー側で Agent Computer の復旧をお願いします。English:\u003cbr\u003e\nWindows Grok Bot. Messages first failed to send. I completed Reset Grok Bot’s Computer once. After that, messages appear as sent black bubbles, but there is no reply, even to “hello”. The Computer view is visible. Privacy Mode is enabled. I already signed out and back in. Please do not ask me to reset again. Please recover the Agent Computer on your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend “hello” in a chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe message shows 送信に失敗 (Failed to send).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestart the app and sign out/in.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComplete Reset Grok Bot’s Computer once.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAfter reset, send “hello” again in a new chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe message sometimes appears as a black sent bubble, but there is no reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Computer view is still visible.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bot should accept the message and reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrokbot\u003cbr\u003e\n0.55.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493824-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493824-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T11:10:49.631Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172007,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-sent-messages-but-never-replies-after-reset-windows","display_username":"Izumi March","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138361,